Zeke sees his friend is hurting. He grabs his backpack.

ZEKE
Hey, I got you something. It was supposed to be for celebrating after you made the team...

Zeke pulls out a FADED GREEN GATORADE BOTTLE.

DANNY
O-M-G! Is that...?

ZEKE
...Lance Henry's 2010 Rookie of the Year limited edition Gatorade.

DANNY ^
...Lance Henry's 2010 Rookie of the Year limited edition Gatorade!?

Danny grabs the bottle and examines the picture of YOUNG LANCE HENRY like a holy relic.

DANNY
How did you--

ZEKE
Ebay. It was the last one.

Danny smiles, touched by the gesture.

DANNY
Thanks, Zeke.

ZEKE
Come on! No more sad stuff. Let's toast!

DANNY
We're gonna drink it?

ZEKE
Oh hell yeah. I spent forty bucks, we're drinking it.

DANNY
Okay! But be warned, Lance Henry's Celery Blitz is widely considered the worst celebrity Gatorade flavor of all time.

He holds it up to the setting sun. The drink inside SHIFTS and SPARKLES a little strangely.

ZEKE
And it's been sitting in some guy's garage for 17 years. My hope is it fermented and we get a little buzz.

Reverently, Danny opens the top. A thin trail of SHIMMERING STEAM curls off the surface of the pale green liquid.

DANNY
Weird.

Zeke takes the bottle.
